>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-20 px-4 md:px-8 prose max-w-none">
    <a href="/use-cases" class="text-accent no-underline hover:underline">&larr; Back to Use Cases</a>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">E-Signatures for General Contractors</h1>

    <p>Never start work on a change order without a signature again.</p>

    <h2>Protect your margins on-site</h2>
    <p>Contractors often find themselves on a job site where the scope suddenly changes. The client verbally agrees, but when it's time to invoice, memories fade. You need a legally binding <a href="/security/audit-trails">Audit Trail</a>.</p>

    <p>With usignpdf, you don't need to drive back to the office to print a new contract. Generate a PDF from your phone, upload it to usignpdf, and hand your phone to the client to use our <a href="/tools/signature-generator">Signature Generator</a> right there on the spot. It's fully legal, perfectly tracked, and ensures you get paid for the work you do.</p>

    <p>Explore our <a href="/templates">Templates library</a> for standard work orders.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
